<title>FRANCE: Bouygues nine month sales 49.8 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bouygues nine month sales 49.8 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					49.8</p>
<p>NOTE -The company gave the results in a financial advertisement. It gave no comparative figure but said the turnover was stable compared to the year-ago period.</p>
